    "text": "The Mediation Boards Commission, by virtue of the powers vested in it by Section 4(1) of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act, No. 21 of 2003, invites nominations for the appointment of Chairman and Mediators in respect of resolving all disputes relating to State Lands and Private Lands subject to the provisions contained in the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2261/68 dated 06.01.2022 for the following Panel of Special Mediation Board who is to vacate post in terms of sections 1 to 5 in the Schedule of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act, No. 21 of 2003.",
